@startuml forms-vol09-flow
title Sample flow - pathological anatomy (volume 9)
autonumber

participant "Hospital\n(vol 1)" as H
participant "Pathology\ndept (vol 9)" as PA
participant "Histology\nlab" as HIST

alt deceased patient
  H -> PA : body referred after death
  PA -> PA : 223 register of autopsied bodies\n224 autopsy protocol\n228 body registration
  PA -> HIST : 226 sectional material for histology
else surgical / biopsy specimen
  H -> PA : 225 referral + biopsy / operational specimen
  PA -> PA : 227 biopsy & operational material register
  PA -> HIST : tissue for histology
end
HIST -> PA : histology result
note over HIST
  Tissue results are analysis reports, the same
  pattern as the clinical labs in volume 3.
end note
@enduml
